Well, updated the test module to not driven by TLA. Thanks for the suggestion! updated! thanks Nit: could this anon function have a name Nit: I think VS Code can't infer the type here. Could you add a jsdoc type? I believe I recreated the jsdoc type of this previously, and it's something like `ModuleExports`

```suggestion
    /** @type {ModuleExports} */
